      "07 and 08 compose with presentation=inline and density=compact in one 25 conditions slot for the same decision. No extra confirmation action belongs to 07. Use notice=null for 07 and omit 08 notice when the parent renders the single shared boundary. Standalone 07 defaults to one persistent parameter-modification-is-not-confirmation notice; supplementary details are collapsed, while errors, warnings, hints, unknown, impacts and locks stay visible. Parameter changes invalidate old confirmations only when the host supplies that fact; confirmed snapshots remain readonly. Existing 25 state/action rules and 08 API are unchanged.",
